laminate: Pure Megacarbon with Marine Grade Epoxy Resin (full-length sheet of carbon above and below core from tip to tail)
core: Thermopolymer Starship Core (mega-premium reforestation-certified Poplar, graded for weight and grain consistency, bonded post-consumer recycled Thermopolymer channels)
base: Megadrive XT Base (pure sintered race base, UHMW polyethylene with carbon content and fluro additions, extra thick for enhanced durability)
base tuning: Moonshot Omni-Tune (high-performance race-base structure channelling water at 45-degree angle)
base construction: Die-Cut Base (laser-guided die-cutting technology)
base protection: Inlaid Alloy Skid Plates (ultralight, refined and reshaped to shave weight and protect tail)
